WEBVTT

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.550
Mifune Baseball Park

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.550
Mifune Baseball Park

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:38.080
All right, let's go!

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:15.900
<b>Girl Power, Baseball-Style</b>

00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:19.040
Oh, wow! It's a proper baseball field!

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:22.960
We're playing in a place this fancy?

00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:25.960
Fancy? This is a regular city baseball field.

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:28.830
Is this your first real game, Kandori?

00:02:29.230 --> 00:02:32.970
What're y'all gettin' so keyed up 'bout?

00:02:32.970 --> 00:02:36.560
I guess it's been half a year
since their last game.

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:37.450
Yeah.

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:43.030
We've been counting down the days till
we could put these uniforms on again.

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:49.000
They look good on you first-years, too.

00:02:52.010 --> 00:02:55.720
Wish I could say the same
about the number on my back...

00:02:55.720 --> 00:02:59.990
I'm the only one who looks 
out of place in this thing.

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:04.970
Captains.

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:06.180
Yes!

00:03:07.150 --> 00:03:09.900
Rock, paper, scissors.
Winner chooses who bats first.

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:10.690
Gotcha.

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:12.630
<i>I'll win this and choose to bat second!</i>

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:13.880
Rock, paper...

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:14.840
...scissors!

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:16.950
Aw, shoot.

00:03:16.950 --> 00:03:18.800
We'd like to bat second.

00:03:20.670 --> 00:03:23.790
Each team gets ten minutes'
fielding practice.

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:24.810
Yes, sir!

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:27.260
<b>Fuurin
Academy</b>

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:27.260
<b>Itsuki</b>

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:36.580
We knew their pitcher was good,
but their defense is tight, too.

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:38.980
Looks like they won't give us any freebies.

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:41.900
Third!

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:54.250
Is this a joke? Their team's a bunch of girls!

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:57.190
Four... Five... I count six of 'em.

00:03:57.680 --> 00:04:01.700
Hey, Kobashi, you scouted these guys.
Why didn't you tell us?

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:02.940
Well...

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:05.680
I told him not to.

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:10.270
If you'd known, you wouldn't have
taken them or your game prep seriously.

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:13.870
That's why I made him tell you
only what you needed to know.

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:23.820
This is our first real game, but if you
treat it like a scrimmage, we'll be fine.

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:27.530
Just keep you cool and
play your natural game.

00:04:29.900 --> 00:04:33.920
Hopefully, we'll win and
be back here tomorrow!

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:44.800
Let's have a good game!

00:04:57.120 --> 00:04:59.810
<i>You serious, Coach?</i>

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:03.900
<i>Putting me in as starting
pitcher in this game?</i>

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:09.870
<i>Against girls, our second-year backup
would've been more than enough!</i>

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:22.800
<i>Top of the first inning.</i>

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:31.220
<i>Batting first for Fuurin Academy:
center field, Fujii-san.</i>

00:05:27.440 --> 00:05:28.760
Nice to meet you.

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:40.500
<i>A bow?</i>

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:44.590
<i>She's so polite!</i>

00:05:45.480 --> 00:05:47.400
All right, let's do this!

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:51.550
Keep your eye on the ball!

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.370
Nice to meet you, too!

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:04.000
Nice! Run!

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:10.880
Safe!

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:20.490
<i>That idiot. I knew this would happen.</i>

00:06:20.490 --> 00:06:24.770
Yokouchi. Take them seriously. 
Stop fooling around.

00:06:25.370 --> 00:06:26.820
Yeah, yeah.

00:06:27.100 --> 00:06:28.720
Nice, Chisato!

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:30.780
All right! No outs, runner on first!

00:06:32.650 --> 00:06:36.370
<i>Batting second, shortstop, Sagara-san.</i>

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:39.210
If this were hardball,
that would've busted your knee.

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:44.210
<i>What was that? I was being nice.</i>

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:50.120
<i>Well, all right. Guess I'll just have to show
you the kinda power a man can generate.</i>

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:50.950
Play!

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:52.890
Keep us rolling, Tao!

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:56.700
<i>I guess I pushed my luck
with that slow pitch.</i>

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:59.340
<i>Alrighty, then.</i>

00:07:00.910 --> 00:07:02.690
<i>Time to make you tremble!</i>

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:06.650
Strike!

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:09.510
Did ya see that?!

00:07:09.510 --> 00:07:11.210
All right!

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:14.580
I stole a base.

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:18.570
That idiot.

00:07:18.570 --> 00:07:21.500
How can you be <i>that</i> oblivious?

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:25.250
Daigo, did you throw a sign
to steal a base on his first pitch?

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:28.150
No, I didn't.

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:32.300
But from our recon, I knew 
he was no good at the slide step,

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:37.890
so I gave Chisato the green light to go
whenever she feels she can make it.

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:47.400
<i>Oh, so you're the aggressive type, huh?</i>

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:50.850
<i>Well, whatever. Who cares about runners?</i>

00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:58.540
<i>There's no way a girl can
hit my pitches, anyway!</i>

00:08:02.150 --> 00:08:03.250
Katahira!

00:08:03.800 --> 00:08:04.830
Yokouchi!

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:08.300
Safe!

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:11.050
What? Safe?!

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:13.740
Yokouchi, back home!

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:14.300
What?

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:22.770
Yes!

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:24.810
We took the lead!

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:27.230
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:27.230
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:27.230
<b>Itsuki</b>

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:30.190
Chisato! Nice running!

00:08:30.450 --> 00:08:32.380
Nice hit.

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:35.160
Wow. Now try sounding less enthusiastic.

00:08:35.830 --> 00:08:38.710
<i>We blitzed them and scored
a run in the blink of an eye.</i>

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:41.370
<i>Our starting batters are amazing!</i>

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:43.680
Hara!

00:08:43.680 --> 00:08:44.980
Y-Yes!

00:08:44.980 --> 00:08:45.830
T-Timeout.

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:50.750
Hey, pull yourself together, Yokouchi.

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:52.300
Coach is fuming.

00:08:52.660 --> 00:08:55.560
Can it, will ya? I got this.

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:59.260
Their first two batters were
just faster than I expected.

00:08:59.860 --> 00:09:04.650
But, well, it's not like girls can
play anything but small ball.

00:09:06.920 --> 00:09:09.230
All the same, just don't let your guard down.

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:11.730
We don't even have one out yet.

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:15.200
Okay, okay.

00:09:23.860 --> 00:09:29.540
<i>The video we took of them showed me
they moved well for a girls' team,</i>

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:31.110
<i>but I didn't expect this.</i>

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:36.070
<i>They could barely hit what
the pitching machine fired at them,</i>

00:09:36.070 --> 00:09:39.180
<i>but we only ran recon on them for one day.</i>

00:09:41.270 --> 00:09:44.810
<i>Batting third, second base, Sawa-san.</i>

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:48.740
<i>They </i>shouldn't<i> be able to hit Yokouchi's pitches
all that well, but you never know.</i>

00:09:48.740 --> 00:09:49.270
Play!

00:09:49.660 --> 00:09:51.470
Sawa-san, you can hit it!

00:10:04.110 --> 00:10:08.400
<i>You didn't even tie up 
your annoying long hair.</i>

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:11.590
<i>You should take baseball... more seriously!</i>

00:10:12.850 --> 00:10:13.800
Ball!

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:16.260
Ball two!

00:10:24.820 --> 00:10:26.770
<i>Dammit!</i>

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:41.440
Oh dear. Looks like I cleared the fence.

00:10:43.790 --> 00:10:46.160
Yeah!

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:49.060
That was amazing! Yayoi's amazing!

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:51.120
We've already scored three runs!

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:55.340
Aw, man. It got cleaned up before I got my go.

00:10:56.970 --> 00:10:58.580
<i>Wait a minute.</i>

00:10:59.310 --> 00:11:00.510
<i>What's going on here?</i>

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:03.800
<i>Don't tell me we could actually win this...</i>

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:09.270
<i>That means I'd lose my day off tomorrow, too.</i>

00:11:11.420 --> 00:11:12.480
Yay.

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:13.860
Nice two-run.

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:15.610
That's our Yayoi!

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:18.500
Ya total buzzkill.

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:23.320
Sorry for cleaning up
and ruining your fun, Anita.

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:26.540
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:26.540
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:26.540
<b>Itsuki</b>

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:29.500
Nice! That was great!

00:11:31.840 --> 00:11:32.800
Timeout!

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:47.850
<i>Scouting them and practicing with
the machine are already paying off.</i>

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:53.810
<i>But I never believed it'd go 
this well from the first inning.</i>

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:58.690
<i>We've got baseball girls you can rely on!</i>

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:08.370
Mifune Baseball Park

00:12:06.550 --> 00:12:11.280
<i>Batting fourth, catcher, Kabashima-san.</i>

00:12:11.280 --> 00:12:13.370
All right! Bring it!

00:12:19.870 --> 00:12:22.050
<i>I'm gonna go big, too.</i>

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:30.990
Strike!

00:12:30.990 --> 00:12:32.730
Those are hard to hit.

00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:36.440
He's started aiming his pitches for real.

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:43.610
Yokouchi, remember how I stopped you

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:48.220
from using breaking balls in
our scrimmage last week?

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:50.080
Yes, I remember.

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:54.540
I saw two suspicious
figures hanging around.

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:57.500
I figured they were scouting us.

00:12:58.760 --> 00:13:02.460
Why do you think I made you 
hide your true abilities?

00:13:02.950 --> 00:13:04.420
Don't hold back.

00:13:06.360 --> 00:13:11.430
<i>As long as you don't throw weak pitches, 
they won't be able to hit anything.</i>

00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:14.270
<i>It's goin' outside again.</i>

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:17.190
<i>That's... what I was waitin' for!</i>

00:13:21.380 --> 00:13:22.570
Strike three!

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:24.590
You're out!

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:25.780
<i>It...</i>

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:27.470
<i>It curved?!</i>

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:30.200
A-A breaking ball?!

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:36.000
<i>Batting fifth, pitcher, Sakura-san.</i>

00:13:35.770 --> 00:13:37.080
Anita...

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:38.330
It curved.

00:13:38.780 --> 00:13:41.290
That pitcher ain't all fastballs.

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:42.250
No way!

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:49.300
Strike!

00:13:49.630 --> 00:13:52.760
<i>What the... How's it bending that much?!</i>

00:13:54.070 --> 00:13:55.230
Strike two!

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:01.650
Strike three! You're out!

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:06.820
<i>Batting sixth, third base, Kandori-san.</i>

00:14:06.430 --> 00:14:10.670
Those were sliders.
Didn't know he could do that.

00:14:12.550 --> 00:14:14.790
He wasn't throwin' those when we scouted 'em.

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:17.620
Guess they musta saw us after all.

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:20.240
I'm glad we got three runs right out the gate.

00:14:20.720 --> 00:14:24.840
With those sliders in the mix,
we won't be hitting much.

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:29.920
Strike! You're out!

00:14:29.920 --> 00:14:31.890
Three outs. Change sides!

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:34.640
Whatever!

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:38.410
Three runs oughta be enough to win this!

00:14:38.410 --> 00:14:39.810
Let's do this, Senpai!

00:14:40.110 --> 00:14:41.110
Right!

00:15:04.030 --> 00:15:05.750
All right, let's go!

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:16.970
Nice ball!

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:22.400
<i>Bottom of the first.</i>

00:15:23.220 --> 00:15:29.740
<i>Batting first for Itsuki Middle School:
catcher, Hara-kun.</i>

00:15:34.520 --> 00:15:35.490
Play!

00:15:35.770 --> 00:15:38.450
Okay, let's keep it tight!

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:42.170
<i>It's all on me to hold them off with her pitchin'.</i>

00:15:42.680 --> 00:15:44.880
<i>Time to show off my game callin'!</i>

00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:50.910
Dead ball!

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:52.620
Awesome!

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:53.970
Huh?

00:15:55.630 --> 00:15:57.830
Oh, hm. Good start.

00:15:57.830 --> 00:15:59.390
Let's reset and go!

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:04.480
<i>What the heck?</i>

00:16:07.990 --> 00:16:11.490
Hey, take your cap off when 
you hit someone. Your cap!

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:13.870
Don't you have any manners?

00:16:13.870 --> 00:16:15.450
I-I'm very sorry!

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:18.660
Damn, those guys are annoying.

00:16:18.940 --> 00:16:22.960
<i>Batting second, center field, Takei-kun.</i>

00:16:22.680 --> 00:16:23.520
Play!

00:16:24.280 --> 00:16:27.290
<i>She was fine while warmin' up.</i>

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:29.120
<i>Is she that nervous?</i>

00:16:33.150 --> 00:16:33.970
Ball!

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:36.140
Yeah, nice!

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:38.350
Ball two!

00:16:39.550 --> 00:16:40.310
Ball three!

00:16:46.790 --> 00:16:48.090
<i>This is real bad.</i>

00:16:48.090 --> 00:16:51.230
<i>Control was her only strength.
What's she playin' at?</i>

00:16:51.420 --> 00:16:52.480
<i>What?</i>

00:16:52.870 --> 00:16:56.510
<i>Why isn't it going where I want it to go?</i>

00:16:57.200 --> 00:17:01.410
<i>And why's the plate so freaking far away?!</i>

00:17:08.110 --> 00:17:10.180
Ball! Four balls!

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:14.300
Timeout!

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:15.870
Timeout!

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:22.400
What's goin' on?
Ya gotta pull yerself together!

00:17:22.400 --> 00:17:24.430
We did so well, buildin' up a three-run lead!

00:17:25.030 --> 00:17:27.440
What is it? Ya nervous or somethin'?

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:29.400
I-I'm sorry.

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:31.940
I don't know what's going on, either.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:33.740
It's fine. Don't sweat it.

00:17:33.740 --> 00:17:37.780
This is our first real game.
It's natural to be nervous.

00:17:37.780 --> 00:17:40.370
Stop screeching, Anita.

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:41.490
What?!

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:44.400
I-I ain't sayin' it 'cause I'm angry!

00:17:44.400 --> 00:17:46.330
I'm just sayin' we gotta focus!

00:17:46.860 --> 00:17:49.200
Anyway, Sakura, just let them hit!

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:51.870
Y-Yeah. Trust your teammates behind you.

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:53.530
May I?

00:17:54.220 --> 00:17:55.500
Daigo?

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:04.730
Wh-What are you doing?

00:18:05.300 --> 00:18:07.020
Hm... let's see...

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:09.930
Around here, I guess?

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:13.530
I'm sure you're nervous too,

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:17.900
but maybe the issue with your 
control is the height of the mound.

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:24.220
I checked before the game.
The mound's a bit taller here.

00:18:24.710 --> 00:18:25.370
What?

00:18:26.170 --> 00:18:28.370
Pitchers are delicate, right?

00:18:28.990 --> 00:18:32.720
The bullpen and the mound 
at our school are quite low,

00:18:32.720 --> 00:18:35.090
since they get used every day.

00:18:35.450 --> 00:18:37.880
Are you done yet? Hurry it up.

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:39.470
Ah, I'm sorry!

00:18:40.460 --> 00:18:44.100
I've flattened it a bit, so it should
be closer to what you're used to.

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:46.630
If it's not enough, dig some more.

00:18:46.630 --> 00:18:47.950
R-Right.

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:50.630
You might get a warning
if you overdo it, though.

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:52.740
<i>Her nerves are getting to her.</i>

00:18:52.740 --> 00:18:56.030
<i>Looks like I might be up on the mound soon.</i>

00:18:59.350 --> 00:19:02.990
<i>Our captain went all the way over
to the mound from left field.</i>

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:07.660
<i>Batting third, shortstop, Kobashi-kun.</i>

00:19:07.460 --> 00:19:08.340
Play!

00:19:11.820 --> 00:19:14.340
<i>The height of the mound?</i>

00:19:14.940 --> 00:19:16.550
<i>Are ya serious?</i>

00:19:29.610 --> 00:19:31.060
Strike!

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:33.020
It went in?

00:19:37.930 --> 00:19:39.090
<i>Seriously?</i>

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:42.250
Strike!

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:44.780
She's starting... to get strikes now.

00:19:45.050 --> 00:19:46.900
So what?

00:19:46.900 --> 00:19:50.750
Even if her control is on the money,
those slow-ass balls are easy to hit.

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:53.880
See?

00:20:00.650 --> 00:20:01.130
Out!

00:20:01.710 --> 00:20:04.340
Yes, a double play!

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:11.770
<i>She's finally on top of her nerves.</i>

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:14.700
Close!

00:20:24.510 --> 00:20:25.980
A bit lower!

00:20:28.980 --> 00:20:30.550
I know, I know!

00:20:31.260 --> 00:20:32.040
Wait a sec!

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:35.710
Uh, Pop?

00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:43.080
All right. Check this out.

00:20:53.070 --> 00:20:54.730
Nice ball!

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:59.080
Were you adjusting the mound just now?

00:20:59.080 --> 00:21:03.200
Yeah, it was a bit higher than I'm used to.

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:06.410
I dug down a bit where I put my pivot leg.

00:21:06.930 --> 00:21:11.910
I see. So even you care about
little things like that, huh?

00:21:13.260 --> 00:21:17.810
You numbskull.
Pitchers are delicate creatures!

00:21:17.810 --> 00:21:21.130
Listen, if your pitcher ever has
difficulties finding their groove,

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:24.030
try checking things like this, too.

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:29.220
<i>Thanks, Pop. Your advice really helped.</i>

00:21:36.380 --> 00:21:39.350
I'm sorry. I didn't get a good hit.

00:21:39.350 --> 00:21:42.540
What were you looking at
when you scouted this team?

00:21:43.830 --> 00:21:48.130
"Fuurin Middle's female pitcher
only has decent control,

00:21:48.130 --> 00:21:50.900
so it'll be a walk in the park"?

00:21:51.460 --> 00:21:53.900
You didn't even realize
you didn't get a good hit

00:21:53.900 --> 00:21:56.380
because she <i>made</i> you hit it like that.

00:22:07.950 --> 00:22:08.380
Out!

00:22:08.750 --> 00:22:09.800
Huh?

00:22:11.100 --> 00:22:13.560
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:22:11.100 --> 00:22:13.560
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:22:11.100 --> 00:22:13.560
<b>Itsuki</b>

00:22:11.480 --> 00:22:13.560
Three outs! Change sides!

00:22:13.960 --> 00:22:15.520
Nice, Mutsuko!

00:24:00.610 --> 00:24:01.960
We can't hit those sliders.

00:24:02.490 --> 00:24:03.710
This is bad.

00:24:03.710 --> 00:24:05.790
We have to come up with a strategy!

00:24:05.790 --> 00:24:07.510
O-Oh, right.

00:24:07.510 --> 00:24:09.730
Tanba-san? Is something wrong?

00:24:09.730 --> 00:24:13.120
When I'm under pressure,
I fall apart in offense and defense.

00:24:14.400 --> 00:24:16.720
Are we going to lose again because of me?

00:24:16.720 --> 00:24:18.260
Ball, don't come my way!

00:24:18.260 --> 00:24:20.370
Tanba-san, please calm down!

00:24:20.370 --> 00:24:22.240
Next time: "Backup."

00:24:21.020 --> 00:24:24.980
<b>Backup</b>

00:24:22.240 --> 00:24:24.110
Run to the stage of your dreams!
